        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Start from Nothing, Rule Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stranded in Hyland Point</strong> — a corrupt coastal metropolis where crime is survival. You’re a broke, unknown street dealer with no connections, no product, and a city that wants you dead. Every district has its rules. Only the ruthless rise.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873190/extras/a4fdf7852455b6e859e89b94674e3c68.poster.avif?t=1775813080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873190/extras/a4fdf7852455b6e859e89b94674e3c68.webm?t=1775813080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominate the Underworld</strong> by growing, mixing, and selling illicit products:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Cheap Street Drugs</strong> to high-value designer strains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experiment with Formulas</strong>: Mix components, unlock rare goods, and create unique products that crush competitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control Demand</strong>: Flood the streets with exclusive substances to become the city’s top supplier.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873190/extras/f31dad094c1b8bd7e19ea25954328fae.poster.avif?t=1775813080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873190/extras/f31dad094c1b8bd7e19ea25954328fae.webm?t=1775813080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873190/extras/f31dad094c1b8bd7e19ea25954328fae.mp4?t=1775813080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><strong>Survive the Pressure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate a Treacherous World</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade Police</strong>: Outsmart raids, investigations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crush Rivals</strong>: Battle gangs and cartels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk It All</strong>: One wrong move means jail — or a bullet.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand Your Operation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest Blood Money Wisely</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy Properties</strong>: Secure labs, stash houses, and territory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arm Your Crew</strong>: Upgrade from rusty vans to armored vehicles that survive high-speed chases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acquire Rare Gear</strong>: Source cutting-edge equipment and ingredients to boost production.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873190/extras/c7ae7ead3502496e10d5c268f93f21c6.poster.avif?t=1775813080\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873190/extras/c7ae7ead3502496e10d5c268f93f21c6.webm?t=1775813080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873190/extras/c7ae7ead3502496e10d5c268f93f21c6.mp4?t=1775813080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become Untouchable</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovate. Dominate. Conquer.</strong><br>Master the criminal ecosystem of Hyland Point — where only the smartest, fiercest, and most cunning rule the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Streets Are Waiting. How Far Will You Go?</strong></p>",
